# Ignore everything in scratch/ by default, except what this project tracks.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file is intentionally IDENTICAL on every branch, and
# whitelists ALL FOUR evaluation harnesses even though each branch carries
# only one of them. Whitelisting only the local harness is a footgun: copying
# or cherry-picking another branch's harness in would leave it silently
# untracked, and the mistake surfaces only when someone else clones and the
# file is not there.
/*
!.gitignore

!nested-subdir/
!subdir/
!scratch-simulator.cc
!CMakeLists.txt

# The four evaluation harnesses (one per defense branch) and the feature
# collector they all share. olsr_window_features.h MUST stay byte-identical on
# every branch -- it is what makes the four defenses' datasets comparable.
# See docs/SCHEMA.md.
!olsr-trust-eval-mitigation.cc
!olsr-fpnt-eval-mitigation.cc
!olsr-dcfm-eval-mitigation.cc
!olsr-watchdog-eval-mitigation.cc
!olsr_window_features.h
